## 🌐 Infrastructure & Attack Surface Mapping

### Subdomain & Domain Enumeration
* **[OWASP Amass](https://github.com/owasp-amass/amass)**  
  In-depth network mapping and external attack surface discovery using active/passive technique combinations, graph databases, and web scraping.
* **[Subfinder](https://github.com/projectdiscovery/subfinder)**  
  Fast, modular passive subdomain enumeration tool designed to harvest valid subdomains via passive online sources.
* **[Certstream](https://certstream.calidog.io/)**  
  Real-time stream parser for Certificate Transparency logs to discover newly issued SSL/TLS certificates globally.

### Internet Scanners & Visual Search
* **[Shodan](https://www.shodan.io/)**  
  Search engine for internet-connected devices, industrial control systems, and open ports.
* **[Censys](https://censys.io/)**  
  Data-driven threat hunting platform that analyzes servers, certificates, and operational hosts across the internet.
* **[FOFA](https://fofa.info/)**  
  Cyberspace search engine that identifies internet-facing assets using tailored signature fingerprints.

