## 👤 Identity Resolution & Social Reconnaissance

* **[Maigret](https://github.com/soxoj/maigret)**  
  Advanced username lookup tool that checks user profile existence across 3,000+ sites, generating comprehensive HTML report dossiers.
* **[Holehe](https://github.com/megadose/holehe)**  
  Checks if a target email address is registered on 120+ web platforms without notifying the target or triggering password reset tokens.
* **[GHunt](https://github.com/mxrch/GHunt)**  
  Offensive Google Account footprinting tool that extracts Google ID, GaiaID, connected services, YouTube channels, and public reviews.
* **[Blackbird](https://github.com/p1ngul1n0/blackbird)**  
  Rapid OSINT tool written in Python that enumerates user accounts across social networks via asynchronous HTTP requests.

