## 🛰️ GEOINT & Spatial Intelligence

* **[SunCalc](https://suncalc.org/)**  
  Solar position and shadow calculator mapped to time and geographic coordinates—essential for photo/video chronolocation.
* **[Overpass Turbo](https://overpass-turbo.eu/)**  
  Web-based data mining tool for OpenStreetMap using custom queries to locate specific infrastructure, street furniture, or geographic features.
* **[PeakFinder](https://www.peakfinder.org/)**  
  3D elevation model that generates digital horizon panoramas from any point on Earth to match mountain landscapes in target imagery.
* **[ExifTool](https://exiftool.org/)**  
  Read, write, and manipulate image, audio, and video metadata (EXIF, IPTC, XMP, GPS parameters).

