## 🛡️ Threat Intelligence, Leaks & Breaches

* **[OpenCTI](https://github.com/OpenCTI-Platform/opencti)**  
  Enterprise-grade open-source platform for managing cyber threat intelligence knowledge and STIX2 indicators.
* **[MISP](https://www.misp-project.org/)**  
  Open-source threat intelligence sharing platform for gathering, sharing, storing, and correlating IOCs of targeted attacks.
* **[GreyNoise](https://www.greynoise.io/)**  
  Mass scanner analysis engine that separates background internet noise and benign crawlers from targeted malicious activity.
* **[HaveIBeenPwned API](https://haveibeenpwned.com/API/v3)**  
  Industry standard service for analyzing credential exposure across historical public data breaches.

