## 💻 Codebase, Cloud & Repository OSINT

* **[TruffleHog](https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog)**  
  Searches commit histories, branches, S3 buckets, and file systems for exposed high-entropy strings and API keys.
* **[GitFive](https://github.com/m4ll0k/GitFive)**  
  OSINT tool designed to track down GitHub profiles via email addresses, commit signatures, and SSH public key fingerprints.
* **[Cloud_Enum](https://github.com/initstring/cloud_enum)**  
  Multi-cloud OSINT tool that enumerates public resources across AWS (S3, AppServices), Azure (Storage, Apps), and GCP (Buckets).

