## 🧅 Darknet & Anonymized Networks

* **[Ahmia](https://ahmia.fi/)**  
  Search engine for Tor hidden services that indexes active `.onion` sites while filtering out illegal material.
* **[TorBot](https://github.com/DedSecInside/TorBot)**  
  Open-source dark web intelligence tool built to crawl `.onion` domains, extract page titles, harvest email addresses, and save network graphs.
* **[OnionSearch](https://github.com/megadose/OnionSearch)**  
  Python script to scrape and aggregate search results concurrently across multiple dark web search engines.

